The 2940UW has an aic7880 chip, right?

> sd1(ahc0:0:5:0): SCB 6a - timed out while idle, SEQADDR == 0xa
> SCSIRATE == 0x0
> sd1(ahc0:0:5:0): Queuing a BDR SCB
